  "modification": "A321XLR adaptation based on the licensed FlightGear A321neo exterior\n\nNarendran, Malik, Jon A. Ortuondo (Bicyus), Fabio Nicotra (Artix), LemiCandy and credited FlightGear A320-family contributors.\nSource: https://github.com/LemiCandy/A320neo\nCommit: acf849854dd17226400c603d8f31a2617eea6c49\nEntry: Models/A321neo.xml\nLicense: GNU GPL v3.0 (LICENSE); upstream GNU GPL v2.0 COPYING is also retained.\n\nThis is an explicit project adaptation of the upstream A321neo, not an original downloadable XLR-specific model. Original source AC3D geometry, native TEXCOORD_0, PNG bytes, object identities and XML rest transforms are retained. Converted to glTF 2.0; neutral mesh dimensions centred and scaled from 44.5234 m to 44.51 m; empty object nodes removed; stock tip fences omitted for native neo sharklets; material aliases assigned for selectable liveries. Simulator runtime supplies animated systems and documented XLR differences. FlightGear Nasal, systems and original property animations are not copied as executable code.\n\nSource files and reproducible conversion scripts are recorded in the model import record.\n",
  "omitted": [
    "FlightDeck/interior/instrument assemblies (provided separately by game)",
    "FlightGear particle effects",
    "stock Wingtips tip fences replaced by native neo sharklets",
    "empty AC3D objects"
  ],
